a real life massive communication such as in the movie-series "V" or
the Star Trek episode "First Contact" 

  Waking up from cryonic suspension in the idealized and wonderful
future often sounds c00l, but I don't think we realize how connected
we are with our local surroundings, our friends, our social network.

