Stephen J. Whitrow writes:
> Ray Cromwell replies:
> Has an economy ever published theories of relativity, invented the
> electric light bulb, or showed that electricity and magnetism always
> co-exist?  If we stretch this to "market", you could have the free market
> of scientific ideas / free inventors as producers, as well as the
